from the surface energies of Table~I of Ref.~\cite{Patra2020} and the experimental values quoted there.
\textcolor{red}{JCP}: Table~II as printed in Ref.~\cite{Patra2020}. ME, MAE in J\,m$^{-2}$, MARE in \%. Agreement shows
